      "id": 6055,
      "name": "Riffian",
      "username": "Riffian",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/ecae2f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-06T16:29:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>…What are you doing with your original core set? Are you keeping it? Giving/selling it to someone else?</p>\n<p>I missed the Kickstarter, so now I’m debating buying the Enhanced Edition. My original copy of the game has (only) been played a few times, so I’m not sure if I should</p>\n<ol>\n<li>keep playing but keep it in good condition so I can give it away or sell it and buy EE;</li>\n<li>play it to death and get the expansions before I get EE;</li>\n<li>keep the original game, buy EE, then expand.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Thoughts?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:52.956Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 1,
